    {
      "@id": "docs/source/concepts-knowledge-graph/what-is-declared-today.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "(top of block)",
      "prov:value": "**Three of those kinds were one until 2026-09-21.** `cat-harness` was declared\nby 22 directories that between them held Skills, Workflows, Scenarios and\nmethodologies — four branches of the taxonomy above, indistinguishable to any\nconsumer filtering on kind.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/source/concepts-knowledge-graph/what-is-declared-today.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "(top of block)",
      "prov:value": "**What the split cost, and where it nearly went wrong.** Two directories that\nhad been reached by *convention* stopped being reached the moment their parent\nchanged kind: `processes/` and `methodologies/crdm/processes/` both sat\ninside a `cat-harness` directory and were found by walking it."
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/source/concepts-knowledge-graph/what-is-declared-today.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "(top of block)",
      "prov:value": "Through the\n**kind**, and that is the mechanism rather than a stopgap — settled by the\nowner, 2026-09-21.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-21",
        "owner"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/source/concepts-knowledge-graph/what-is-declared-today.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "(top of block)",
      "prov:value": "Three instances — `agent-skills`, `cat-harness` and\n`who-style-guide` (since folded into the IRIS replica, bean `qsx4`) — each declared their own `voices/` directory of kind\n`voices`, and the overlay resolves all three together.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean qsx4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/source/concepts-knowledge-graph/what-is-declared-today.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "(top of block)",
      "prov:value": "The alternative considered and set aside was letting a directory entry declare\nnested subgraph directories, so that a shared body would live at a path such as\n`skills/voices/` and dependents would add under the same path."
    }
  ]
